  "body": "Previously it was ambiguous whether module scripts also contained all\r\nthe fields of classic scripts, or just those of the base script type.\r\nThe latter is correct.\r\n\r\nFixes #2262.\r\n\r\n--\r\n\r\nThis is a bit verbose, so shorter suggestions that still manage to remain unambiguous are welcome.",
